lay: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          风\n         </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          味：茉莉、金桔、甜橙、柚子茶\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Jasmine, Tangerine, Orange, Honey pomelo tea-like\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          厌氧水洗批次售罄后，我们又挑选到一只传统水洗的批次，相比上一只厌氧水洗它的酸质和整体风味更为的清新上扬，柑橘调性，特别是橘子调超级突出，香气带有茉莉花香，高温时能感受到明显的金桔转甜橙，酸质中等，特别的柔顺，甜感随着入口的时间推移逐渐提高，到最后的尾韵如同橘子糖一般，中温开始越来越好喝，又好像蜂蜜柚子茶般～特别的丰富耐喝\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于詹庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          詹森庄园的历史可以追溯到1926年，当年仅21岁的\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Carl Axel Janson和妻子\n           <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n            Peggy Janson\n           </span>\n           从瑞典来到巴拿马这块富饶而又原始的土地；随后Carl购置了一个农场用来做乳品生意，从瑞典引入了Brangus牛与一些不同的马种，又从佛罗里达引入了不同的鱼种投入到庄园附近的湖中来打造一个多样多元的农场，这些都展示出了他独到与长远规划的眼光。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJ5AibBwjia2QCxzeboJoUq9hZjAAzY2R1LMcCvcATpKDJekWTgmKAb3yA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           1980年代中期，家族意识到农场的自然风土条件对于咖啡种植的适宜性，于是开启了咖啡的种植，1990年Carl的儿子（\n           <span style='letter-spacing: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n            Ricardo, Carl, Peter and Michael）\n           </span>\n           接管了农场的业务，成立了Jason Coffee，继续秉承着父亲对于农场生态，对于家族生意以及对于所有产品的品质要求发展下属的所有业务，也是詹森开始进入咖啡领域的开始。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJO5bibt86ZE0AicPmJice1GImqIMLFhJOW3ZzdXB5F3FgPAHEcsrCn3A0Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           30多年过去了，现在庄园有Carl的孙子辈的Kai和Janette以及家族第四代Miguel（Janette的儿子）来管理运营，庄园种植品种有卡杜艾、卡杜拉、帕卡马拉以及瑰夏。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          查资料时，查到农场里有一处设施让我感觉到很温馨和感动，就是给所有工人们提供的小儿子Day Care中心，身为父母（小朋友还年龄较小）的我非常有感触，一个让你放心踏实的托儿所是多么的重要，这里可以让工人们踏实放心的去工作，小孩子在这里有玩了的设施，有老师看管做一些早教工作，真的是超级超级棒！\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJLCVFgRedpdTfPNzZJY2hqAXanaFjdFX1npuXTVvJom3QwKHmS3aa1A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          除此之外，家族对于环保和生态保护也有自己的一些实践，比如在自己的咖啡店或者农场里使用玻璃器具以及可循环使用的容器避免塑料垃圾的生成；还有一个为了保护附近的原始生态的保育室，由Miguel来负责管理，从农场附近的原始森林里收集一些原生的植株种子在这里保育，同时也开放一部分空间给公众，对于来访的自然爱好者客人们可以从这里拿一些回家自己培养种植；农场的电力主要有400块太阳能板来供给，同时燃烧的燃料也来源于咖啡生产过程中的一些产物比如说羊皮纸。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;