o Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次 Lagunas\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这个批次来自于农场的一个地块Lagunas，它的名字来源于附近的Lagoon湖与湿地，位于1350 - 1400米的海拔高度。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style='font-family: sy